+```text
+q = t^6 + 8*t^2
+p = t^9 + 12*t^5 + 24*t
+G96 = p^2 - q^3 + a15*p*q + a12*q^2 + a9*p + a6*q
+(a15,a12,a9,a6) = (0,0,0,-64)
