+q = t^6 + b*t^4 + d*t^2 + f
+```
+
+so `p` and `q` are even polynomials in `t`.  Since `G86` is a polynomial in
+`p` and `q`, every odd coefficient of `G86` vanishes on this locus.  I checked
+this directly in SymPy:
+
+```text
