+## 2. Correct Specification Re-derived
+
+The audit's shared `(8,6)` chart is, in its notation,
+
+```text
+p = t^8 + B t^5 + C t^4 + D t^3 + E t^2 + F t + G
+q = t^6 + b t^4 + gamma t^3 + d t^2 + e t + f
+H = p^3 - q^4 = sum h_j t^j
+```
